{
  "title": "ConfirmSensorConfiguration",
  "messageId": "0801",
  "isCommand": false,
  "description": "This message is used to notify a client component that the configuration has been received with the values specified in the corresponding set message with Request ID matching the value of field 1 of this message. If the specified configuration request is deemed valid, the SensorIdRec is returned with the matching SensorID (or illuminatorID) of the \n\t\t\tsensor (or illuminator) for which the configuration was successfully \n\t\t\tset. If the requested configuration is invalid, one of the ErrorRec \n\t\t\ttypes shall be returned (depending on the source message) with \n\t\t\tan error code and description of the configuration setting which \n\t\t\twas deemed invalid.",
